<%# A section opened by lists with icons (decision: prototype "Création façon jeu"): each list as cards with their
    emblem and name, the option picked explained under them (character_sheets/sections/_option_cards_list). One list
    (the class) on one centered column, six cards by line; several (the background and the species) side by side on a
    wide section, each with its title, one under the other on a narrow one. A field that depends on one of them (the
    lineage on the species, options_from) goes under it; the other fields of the section (the size) under the last
    list, beside it.
    The cards are radio buttons, sent with the form; option_cards_controller.js keeps the hidden fields the page reads
    in step (CharacterSheets::OptionCardsHelper), and described_choices_controller.js shows the options picked %>
<% card_fields = option_card_fields(fields) %>
<% side_by_side = card_fields.size > 1 %>
<div class="clear-left flex flex-col items-center gap-8 [@media(max-height:820px)]:gap-5"
     data-controller="option-cards described-choices details-dialog"
     data-action="change->described-choices#show input->described-choices#show">
  <%= render "shared/details_dialog" %>
  <div class="<%= side_by_side ? "grid w-full items-start gap-10 @5xl:grid-cols-2 @5xl:gap-8" : "contents" %>">
    <% card_fields.each do |field| %>
      <%= render "character_sheets/sections/option_cards_list",
                 character: character, field: field, all_fields: all_fields, computed: computed,
                 side_by_side: side_by_side, following_fields: option_card_following_fields(fields, field) %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
